<title>FINLAND: Finnish T-bill auction raises FIM 1.0 bln.</title>
<headline>Finnish T-bill auction raises FIM 1.0 bln.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury Office's T-Bill auction November 19 versus November 12  SUVK :</p>
<p>		     THIS AUCTION/PREVIOUS AUCTION</p>
<p> Maturity, days   85	   358/365</p>
<p> Avge yld, pct   3.01	  3.38/No bids accepted</p>
<p> Highest yld(cut)3.01	  3.38</p>
<p> Lowest  yld     3.01	  3.38</p>
<p> Amount, FIM million  500	  500/nil</p>
<p> Bids, FIM million  2,436	  920/250</p>
<p>Total planned issue amount was 1.0 billion markka. After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 36,550 million markka, the STO said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
